      <Parameter>
         <Name>Shutterless Stokes I, Q, U, and V Images</Name>
         <ParameterKey>HDU:0</ParameterKey>
         <Description>Three-dimensional Level 0 SOT-FG full-Stokes image data stored in the FITS Primary HDU. The first two array dimensions represent spatial image coordinates, and the third dimension contains four image planes corresponding to Stokes I, Q, U, and V. The shutterless observing mode ordinarily uses a restricted field of view. Observations are made at selected discrete passbands rather than over a continuous wavelength range; the FITS keywords WAVE and WAVEOFF indicate the recorded passband and offset. The images have not undergone ground-based scientific calibration.</Description>
